{"turn_id": "d07-t1", "session_id": "d07", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "feature_subgroups", "text": "特征集被划分为五个子组：长度特征、词汇特征、形态特征、句法特征和语义特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-95d315be5888ab22f7efbd62"}]}, {"key": "length_features", "text": "长度特征（Len）包括按词元数计和按字符数计的句子长度、超长词（超过十三个字符）以及传统瑞典语可读性公式 LIX。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-95d315be5888ab22f7efbd62"}]}, {"key": "lexical_features", "text": "词汇特征（Lex）基于 Kelly 词表（提供每个词元的 CEFR 等级和频率），使用每千词的 incidence scores（IncSc），包括各 CEFR 等级词语的 IncSc、高于文本或句子 CEFR 等级的难词、不在 Kelly 词表中的词元、未找到词元的词元以及平均对数频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-95d315be5888ab22f7efbd62"}]}, {"key": "morphological_features", "text": "形态特征（Morph）包含各类别变异度、所有词汇类别及标点、小品词、从属连词和并列连词的 IncSc、中性性别名词的 IncSc、不同动词形式与所有动词的比例、双对数和平方根 TTR、名词比率、代词与介词比率、词汇密度特征，以及由关系副词、限定词、代词和物主词构成的关系结构。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-56c4d684e5cbe3b1ead9168e"}]}, {"key": "syntactic_features", "text": "句法特征（Synt）基于依存弧的长度（深度）和方向，并包括分裂句中关系从句的 IncSc，以及前置和后置修饰语（如形容词和介词短语）的 IncSc。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-56c4d684e5cbe3b1ead9168e"}]}, {"key": "semantic_features", "text": "语义特征（Sem）基于瑞典语词汇语义资源 SALDO，使用每词元的平均义项数，并包含每个名词的平均名词义项数。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-56c4d684e5cbe3b1ead9168e"}]}, {"key": "feature_sources", "text": "特征是根据已有文献和一本面向瑞典语 L2 学习者的语法书开发的。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-95d315be5888ab22f7efbd62"}]}, {"key": "feature_combination_finding", "text": "在句子层面，与仅使用词汇特征相比，使用不同特征的组合使分类准确率提高了 7%；而在文档层面，词汇特征更具主导性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-f16421f0ee652e6ad37ac288"}]}, {"key": "lexical_alone_document", "text": "在文档层面仅使用词汇特征，就能达到与完整特征集大致相同的性能（词汇特征约 0.8 F，全部特征 0.81 F）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-002c247f705e15494a446b37"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d07-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d07-t2", "session_id": "d07", "turn": 2, "answer": {"decision": "clarify", "claims": [], "text": "请明确所指论文或比较对象。"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d07-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": false, "pipeline_success": false, "behavior_match": false, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": null, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": false, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d07-t3", "session_id": "d07", "turn": 3, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "readable_linguistic_features", "text": "《A Readable Read》提出的受监督机器学习模型基于一系列语言学特征（a range of linguistic features）来按难度等级分类文本，并指出以往用于可读性任务的 linguistic features 包含来自词性标注器（POS taggers）和依存句法分析器（dependency parsers）的信息，以及 Coh-Metrix 中认知动机特征。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}, {"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-cbb7f9f0d9a80a8b97da806b"}]}, {"key": "readable_feature_combination", "text": "《A Readable Read》发现，在句子级别使用不同特征的组合相比仅使用词汇特征可使分类准确率提升 7%，而在文档级别词汇特征更为主导。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}]}, {"key": "bert_agree_features", "text": "《Does BERT agree?》研究与句法结构相关的四种一致关系类型（主语-动词、名词-限定词、名词-定语形容词、主语-谓语形容词），并考察四种形态句法特征：数、性、格和人。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.09892", "chunk_id": "c-9f675d6ede718ba758d6abae"}]}, {"key": "bert_agree_expansion", "text": "《Does BERT agree?》将研究扩展到 26 种语言、四种一致关系类型，而此前工作主要局限于英语主语-动词的数一致。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.09892", "chunk_id": "c-3b6a3b675e9322866e554792"}, {"paper_id": "1908.09892", "chunk_id": "c-9f675d6ede718ba758d6abae"}]}, {"key": "bert_agree_mono_multi", "text": "《Does BERT agree?》表明单语 BERT 和多语 BERT 模型总体上都能很好地捕捉对句法敏感的一致模式，且以往评估 BERT 句法知识的工作仅聚焦于单语英语模型。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.09892", "chunk_id": "c-8593be887a77aa84b6245970"}, {"paper_id": "1908.09892", "chunk_id": "c-9f675d6ede718ba758d6abae"}]}, {"key": "bert_agree_single_bert_result", "text": "在该论文引述的前人工作中，单语 BERT 模型在英语主语-动词数一致 cloze 任务上表现出色（所有实验准确率高于 80%）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.09892", "chunk_id": "c-3b6a3b675e9322866e554792"}]}, {"key": "bert_agree_unfair_multi_comparison", "text": "该论文指出跨语言比较是不公平的，因为尽管数据集以相同方法构建，每种语言的数据集不同（例如巴斯克语样例可能比葡萄牙语更难），这影响对多语言表现的解读。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1908.09892", "chunk_id": "c-8218ac945611f7d8d4659357"}]}, {"key": "readable_no_mono_multi", "text": "所提供的《A Readable Read》证据未涉及单语与多语 BERT 的对比，该论文的任务是瑞典语二语学习材料的复杂度预测（5 级量表）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}]}, {"key": "comparability", "text": "两篇论文不具备直接可比性：研究对象与任务不同（《A Readable Read》用基于词性/依存等语言学特征的监督模型预测文本/句子复杂度，而《Does BERT agree?》用 cloze 任务评估 BERT 对一致关系的句法敏感性），且仅《Does BERT agree?》讨论了单语与多语 BERT。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1603.08868", "chunk_id": "c-619fec3b6e7991135faaea3f"}, {"paper_id": "1908.09892", "chunk_id": "c-8593be887a77aa84b6245970"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d07-t3", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
